# GO-2026-5932: golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is unmaintained and unsafe by design.
#
# Not applicable to this project:
#   - provisr only imports golang.org/x/crypto/bcrypt (internal/auth); the
#     openpgp package is never linked in.
#   - govulncheck reports 0 called vulnerabilities for ./...
#   - Upstream publishes no fixed version, and x/crypto is already at the
#     latest release (v0.54.0), so there is nothing to upgrade to.
#
# Re-evaluate if provisr ever starts using OpenPGP.
GO-2026-5932
